    "locator": "e2020JB019964",
    "doi": "10.1029/2020JB019964"
   },
   "sample_composition": "Nominal (Mg0.5Fe3+0.5)(Al0.5Si0.5)O3 (FA50); the two synthesis runs analyzed as (Mg0.50Fe0.52)(Al0.47Si0.51)O3 and (Mg0.47Fe0.52)(Al0.46Si0.55)O3, without a published mapping to XRD sample 1 versus sample 2.",
   "iron_speciation": "Initially high-spin Fe3+ occupies the A site. Stepwise laser annealing permits gradual Fe-Al exchange, placing a pressure-increasing minority of Fe3+ on the B site where it becomes low spin. Spectroscopy reports approximately 6% low-spin Fe3+ at 59 GPa and method-dependent 17-31% at 80 GPa. This preferred curve spans a pressure-dependent mixed-spin population and is not a fully low-spin branch.",
   "eos": {
    "type": "BM2",
