    "diffraction": "Angle-dispersive synchrotron XRD at APS 13-ID-D, 3 micrometre beam, wavelength 0.3344 angstrom, with +/-10 degree wide scans; Dioptas integration and Le Bail refinement in GSAS.",
    "thermal_history": "After initial transformation/annealing near 27 GPa, sample 1 was compressed stepwise and laser annealed at 1600-2200 K for 10-25 minutes after selected measurements. The fit uses all 23 room-temperature volumes measured both before and after the current pressure-step anneal.",
    "excluded_reflections": "Overlapping sample, Au, and Ne peaks were excluded during lattice refinement."
