    "year": 2023,
    "title": "Crystal chemistry and compressibility of Fe0.5Mg0.5Al0.5Si0.5O3 and FeMg0.5Si0.5O3 silicate perovskites at pressures up to 95 GPa",
    "source": "Frontiers in Chemistry",
